/-!
# The doubled-origin covering of the involution quotient

Stacks 05ZI covers the algebraic space `X = 𝐀¹_k/\{x ∼ -x ∣ x ≠ 0\}` of Stacks 05Z6 by the
affine line with its origin doubled. This file re-exports its three parts:

* `StacksFrontier.Examples.Spaces.DoubledLineEtaleCovering.CoveringMorphism`: the doubled line and
  the morphism `Y ⟶ X`;
* `StacksFrontier.Examples.Spaces.DoubledLineEtaleCovering.CartesianSquare`: the cartesian square
  of the remark;
* `StacksFrontier.Examples.Spaces.DoubledLineEtaleCovering.FiniteEtaleDegreeTwo`: the covering
  clause, `Y ⟶ X` a nontrivial connected finite étale covering of degree two.
-/
